<p style="font-size:16px; font-weight:bold; margin-top:0;">
REAL WORLD CONNECTION: Why Does TikTok “Know” What You Like?
</p>

<p style="font-size:16px;">
Apps like TikTok, YouTube, Spotify, and Netflix use AI recommendation systems to predict what users are most likely to watch, listen to, or click next.
</p>

<p style="font-size:16px;">
These systems learn from patterns in user behavior — including what people pause on, replay, skip, search for, or share.
</p>

<p style="font-size:16px; margin-bottom:0;">
Over time, the AI begins making assumptions about what users like and continuously reshapes their feeds based on those predictions.
</p>

</div>
